        "title": {
          "en": "OpenAI to Honor Robots.txt for AI Training Preferences",
          "zh": "OpenAI将尊重Robots.txt，以管理AI训练偏好"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "OpenAI announced it will honor a shared robots.txt signal to assist website operators in communicating their AI training preferences to participating providers.",
          "zh": "OpenAI宣布将尊重共享的robots.txt信号，以帮助网站运营者向参与的提供商传达其AI训练偏好。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "OpenAI will honor a shared robots.txt signal.",
            "This signal assists website operators in communicating their AI training preferences.",
            "The preference communication is directed to participating providers."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "OpenAI将尊重共享的robots.txt信号。",
            "此信号旨在帮助网站运营者传达其AI训练偏好。",
            "偏好沟通面向参与的提供商。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This development provides website operators with a standardized mechanism to manage how their content is used for AI training. It introduces a common protocol for data usage communication within the AI ecosystem.",
          "zh": "这一进展为网站运营者提供了一个标准化机制，以管理其内容如何被用于AI训练。它在AI生态系统内引入了一种通用的数据使用沟通协议。"
        },
        "source": "OpenAI News",
        "link": "https://openai.com/index/helping-websites-express-ai-training-preferences"
      },
